1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johan in de Betou (den holländska stavningen) b.1639 - Nederländerna d. 1703 -Nacka 
2 CONT Stärkelsefabrikant tillsammans m. brodern, Stärkelsebruk Nacka (AB),  handelsman, borgare
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT  	 Govert in de Betou 1588-1663 i Norrköping o  Welamina van Balen †1665
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouses & children'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1.''' Married 29 December 1665, Norrköpings Olai (E), to '''Elisabet Larsdtotter Hultman''' 1646-1672 (Parents : Lars Hemmingsson Hultman &  Karin Larsdotter) 
2 CONT # Elisabet in de Betou 1668-1742   
2 CONT
2 CONT '''2.'''Married in 1674 to '''Christina Lillienstrahl'''   - †1714/ (Parents : Johan Håkansson Hult adl Lillienstrahl 1614-1698 &  Ingrid Rochus 1623-1700) 
2 CONT # Efraim in de Betou 1675
2 CONT # Welamina in de Betou 1684-1748  
2 CONT # Brita in de Betou 1756- -  g. m Abraham Keyser som övertog Stärkelsefabriken
2 CONT # Maria in de Betou  - †1708
2 CONT
