2 CONT 6 SNPs that reached inclusion criteria (p < 0.2 in univariate logistic regression) 
2 CONT were selected for a series of multivariate logistic regression analyses. 
2 CONT • The best model, explaining 20.5% of variance for survival to the age of 90.0, has 9 
2 CONT SNPs (Table 1). 
2 CONT • Significant association with longevity has been shown for genotypes containing 
2 CONT longevity alleles of TERC rs16847897 and GHRHR rs2267723 (p<0.01), as well as
2 CONT of APOE rs7412 and TNF-α rs1800629 loci (p<0.05), while the same effect was 
2 CONT found in TP53 rs1042522 heterozygotes (p=0.046). 
2 CONT • Loci FOXO3 rs12206094, KLOTHO rs9536314, ERCC2 rs50871, TXNRD1 
2 CONT rs17202060 although not significant also contribute to the overall quality of the 
2 CONT model.
2 CONT • Our study points to TERC rs16847897 and GHRHR rs2267723 as the most 
2 CONT significant genetic predictors for reaching longevity (defined by cut-off age 90.0) in 
2 CONT the Croatian elderly population.
