1 NAME Althéa Maria /Cederberg/
2 GIVN Althéa Maria
2 SURN Cederberg
2 _MARNM Cederberg
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 6 DEC 1689
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Sweden
