2 CONC lmtomta, Ask, 1819-23 Annelund, Motala. Barn: Magdalena f 1787 7/8 d 1858 6/1, Anna Christina f 1789 27/10 d 1790 3/9 koppor, Anna Stina f 1793 10/5 d 1797 18/3, Sophia f 1796 10/3 d 1797 26/2, Anna Stina f 1799 9/4 d 1869 20/4, U
2 CONC lrica Charlotta f 1802 22/5, Hedwig Sophia f 1806 3/5 d 1878.
