1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Owner of farm at Åbyn 4, Burträsk, and sexton (klockare).
2 CONT
2 CONT Olof is shown on with son Anders Hedström at Åbyn, A1:4,69 (1750-1768).
2 CONT Shown Åbyn, Burträsk A1:5.252 (1780-1810) with wife + family; both shown dying.
2 CONT His father was a church pastor, brother was an assistant vicar, and brother #2 was a shore fisherman.
2 CONT Cause of death "Colique och Inflammations Feber" (Colic & inflammatory fever).
2 CONT
2 CONT Olof Hedström's estate inventory was six pages and worth $151.27.9.  Signed his widow Magdalena Hedström, 15 Mar 1793,
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Olof Hedström estate inventory, Burträsks tingslags häradsrätt (AC) FII:1.36 (1768-1794) (AID: v152945.b161.s36, NAD: SE/HLA/1040103), https://www.arkivdigital.se/aid/show/v152945.b161.s36:
