1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Charles XIII & II also Carl, Swedish: Karl XIII (Stockholm, 7 October 1748 – Stockholm, 5 February 1818)
2 CONT * Duke of Södermanland, from 1772
2 CONT *King of Sweden (as Charles XIII) from 1809 and King of Norway (as Charles II) from 1814 until his death. 
2 CONT *Second son of King Adolf Frederick of Sweden and Louisa Ulrika of Prussia, sister of Frederick the Great.
